# Build output for the standalone .NET services (worker, contracts, pos-sim).
# nopCommerce/ has its own .gitignore that covers its subtree.
services/**/bin/
services/**/obj/

# Generated / runtime nopCommerce App_Data. nopCommerce/.gitignore already scopes its
# own subtree; these are a root-level safety net for runtime files only (NOT a broad
# **/App_Data/ rule, which would mask tracked seed data like Localization/Install).
**/App_Data/appsettings.json
**/App_Data/dataSettings.json
**/App_Data/plugins.json
**/App_Data/installedPlugins.json
**/App_Data/Logs/
**/App_Data/DataProtectionKeys/
**/App_Data/TempUploads/

# Build output (belt-and-suspenders; nopCommerce/ and services/ already scope their own)
**/bin/
**/obj/
